<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Elon Musk - Profile & Ventures</title>
  <style>
    /* Reset and Base Styles */
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      background-color: #0b0e14;
      color: #f1f5f9;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 20px;
    }

    /* Main Profile Card */
    .card {
      background-color: #151b26;
      border: 1px solid #2a3441;
      border-radius: 16px;
      max-width: 600px;
      width: 100%;
      overflow: hidden;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    }

    /* Header Banner */
    .banner {
      height: 120px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3a8a, #0f172a);
    }

    /* Profile Content */
    .content {
      padding: 0 30px 30px;
      position: relative;
    }

    .avatar {
      width: 90px;
      height: 90px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background-color: #3b82f6;
      color: white;
      font-size: 32px;
      font-weight: bold;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      border: 4px solid #151b26;
      margin-top: -45px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 26px;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .subtitle {
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-size: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .bio {
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #cbd5e1;
      font-size: 15px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    /* Ventures Grid */
    h2 {
      font-size: 16px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      color: #94a3b8;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }

    .ventures {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .venture-item {
      background-color: #1e2636;
      padding: 12px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      border: 1px solid #2a3441;
    }

    .venture-item strong {
      display: block;
      color: #60a5fa;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .venture-item span {
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #94a3b8;
    }

    /* Quote Footer */
    blockquote {
      border-left: 3px solid #3b82f6;
      padding-left: 14px;
      font-style: italic;
      color: #94a3b8;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="banner"></div>
    <div class="content">
      <div class="avatar">EM</div>
      <h1>Elon Musk</h1>
      <p class="subtitle">Entrepreneur, Engineer &amp; Tech Executive</p>
      
      <p class="bio">
        Born in Pretoria, South Africa, Elon Musk is known for founding and leading companies focused on electric vehicles, space exploration, artificial intelligence, and neurotechnology.
      </p>

      <h2>Key Companies</h2>
      <div class="ventures">
        <div class="venture-item">
          <strong>SpaceX</strong>
          <span>Aerospace &amp; Space Transport</span>
        </div>
        <div class="venture-item">
          <strong>Tesla</strong>
          <span>Electric Vehicles &amp; Clean Energy</span>
        </div>
        <div class="venture-item">
          <strong>xAI</strong>
          <span>Artificial Intelligence</span>
        </div>
        <div class="venture-item">
          <strong>X</strong>
          <span>Social Media &amp; Communications</span>
        </div>
        <div class="venture-item">
          <strong>Neuralink</strong>
          <span>Brain-Computer Interfaces</span>
        </div>
        <div class="venture-item">
          <strong>The Boring Co.</strong>
          <span>Infrastructure &amp; Tunneling</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <blockquote>
        "When something is important enough, you do it even if the odds are not in your favor."
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>

